---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { email } from "../../data.js";
---

<Base
  title="Melaka 1511"
  description="Melaka 1511 is a turn-based strategy game set in the Melaka Sultanate, in the years before the Portuguese arrive in 1511."
  image="/img/melaka-1511.jpg"
>
  <h1>Melaka 1511</h1>
  <p>
    A turn-based strategy game set in the Melaka Sultanate. You start weak after the fall of Temasek, and
    you have until the Portuguese arrive in 1511 to unite the peninsula.
  </p>

  <div class="figure"><img src="/img/melaka-1511.jpg" alt="Melaka 1511, early build" width="720" height="405" /></div>

  <p>
    You use officers like Tun Perak and Hang Tuah to build the economy, raise an army and win over the
    states around you. You trade, govern, defend and negotiate. 1511 changed trade across the whole region,
    and almost no game has touched it.
  </p>
  <p>Voxel art. PC first. The prototype runs.</p>
  <p><a href="https://youtu.be/4TbsJau7QmA">Watch the video</a>.</p>

  <h2>Publishers</h2>
  <p>
    We're talking to publishers now. If you'd like the deck and a build,
    <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Melaka%201511`}>email us</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
